  (text "ESP32-C6-MINI-1 pin table: Espressif datasheet v1.5, table 3-1. Footprint from Espressif's KiCad library."
    (at 20 257 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "0da89ea1-c72e-0b15-993f-daf4f29ef1db"))
  (text "EN is pulled low: the radio stays off until the MCU turns it on, and firmware keeps it off while logging."
    (at 20 262 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "9a46c176-d271-0114-b129-1920f67b9605"))
  (text "Strapping: IO9 high = boot from flash; the MCU pulls RADIO_BOOT low with EN to enter the UART bootloader."
    (at 20 267 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "13ed1484-5ca3-8bbc-9acf-d52a0c0b3600"))
  (text "IO8 must be high for download mode; IO15 must not float. Data: SPI slave on SPI4 (up to 40 MHz)."
    (at 20 272 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "a5a5bd5f-913c-120f-0192-0d1519ff5802"))
  (text "Peak TX current about 0.38 A from +3V3. Antenna over the board edge, no copper under it; case wall there must be plastic."
    (at 20 277 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "d16d43ec-be7c-f900-37e3-54b953dc4036"))
  (text "USB_D-/D+ test pads: USB-Serial-JTAG for bench debugging of the radio firmware."
    (at 20 282 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "f8bae848-9270-2c53-0d59-c14f6f899dc1")))
